CODE CONTRIBUTORS
=================

Initial code was taken from:
http://nehe.gamedev.net/data/lessons/lesson.asp?lesson=10

TGA and JPG file formats loading code was taken from:
http://www.gametutorials.com/Tutorials/opengl/OpenGL_Pg2.htm

Mirror code was taken from a newsgroup post:
http://groups.google.com/groups?q=mirror+opengl&hl=en&lr=&ie=UTF-8&oe=utf-8&selm=53cn35%24h13%40fido.asd.sgi.com&rnum=1

Apache Web Server CVS Repository




TOOLS
=====

Compilers: gcc(g++), icc, VS C++ Copmiler
Source control: CVS, ViewCVS
Web Server: Apache web server
Editor: gvim
Building Tools: MS Visual Stidio, make, autoconf
Image editing: Gimp
Other: cygwin, zip, tar



BOOKS
=====

OpenGL Game Programming by Hawkins and Astle
OpenGL Programming Guide by Woo, Neider, Davis and Shreiner
Mathematics for 3D Game Programming & Computer Graphics by Eric Lengyel



